@graph: AboutPage + the full Organization node (the richest instance: foundingDate, legalName and address only when real) + Person nodes (@id https://logink.co/about#{slug}, jobTitle, sameAs, worksFor → org) only when real + BreadcrumbList.

OG /og/{l}/about.jpg (Putih 05.30). Words: floor 303/285; target 500–800.

Launch gate: the v2 portfolio hub and case template move from (legacy) only after owner decision 5 (data fixes).

Title: 'Portofolio & Studi Kasus Digital Marketing | Logink' / 'Portfolio & Case Studies | Logink'. The meta drops the unsupported 'ROAS tinggi' claim. H1 is localised.

@graph: CollectionPage + ItemList ({case url}#article) + BreadcrumbList. OG /og/{l}/portfolio.jpg. Words: floor 150/148; target 350–600.

Unknown slug → notFound(); today /blog/category/nope returns 200 with index,follow. Posts in this locale below CATEGORY_MIN_POSTS (1) → robots noindex,follow and no sitemap entry.

Title: 'Artikel {nameId}: Panduan & Insight | Logink' / '{nameEn} Articles & Guides | Logink', replacing 'Blog Category: seo', which is English on the ID page. Meta is built from the lede.

@graph: CollectionPage + BreadcrumbList. hreflang only when both locales are indexable. OG: blog.jpg.

Title = metaTitle or title; meta = metaDescription. There must be exactly one H1; the CMS body may not contain an H1 (content lint).

@graph: BlogPosting (headline, image, datePublished, dateModified visible, inLanguage, author → Person @id with url, jobTitle and sameAs when present, publisher → /#organization, never an inline stub) + BreadcrumbList.

hreflang is emitted once, in <head>, only when an EN body exists; today it is emitted twice. OG = ogImage, else featuredImage, else /og/{l}/blog.jpg. The EN route hit by an ID slug → 308 to slugEn, or to the ID URL when there is no EN version. Word count is unchanged (CMS).

interactions.desktop:
Once in view:
- answer words rise in their own masks, 45ms per word, capped at 600ms;
- citation chips rise in masks from 650ms, and chip (2) carries a Jingga ring;
- share-of-voice bars and hairlines scaleX from 0;
- prompt rows light through a pre-tinted ::before;
- the map pin drops ≤6px.
The stagger is capped at 6. Instruments already on screen at scan time are shown final.

Lenis 1.3.23 settings:
- lerp 0.1, autoRaf:false, driven by framer-motion's frame.update(keepAlive), so the page has a single rAF;
- anchors: true honours scroll-padding-top and scroll-margin (verified in lenis.mjs);
- stopInertiaOnNavigate: true;
- wheels inside <dialog> and [popover] stay native.
html{scroll-behavior:smooth} must be deleted from globals.css:62.
